      "content": "but they wouldn't be shattered, they'd just be... lighter. i see the way my wife looks at the bank account and then looks at me and i just feel like this huge, constant error in their lives. if i just stopped being a factor, all that stress goes away. it's like, if a limb is gangrenous, you have to take it off to save the body. doesn't that make sense?",
